paragraph_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p012","quote":"項羽滅秦，立沛公為漢王。漢王賜商爵信成君，以將軍為隴西都尉。別將定北地、上郡。破雍將軍焉氏，周類軍栒邑，蘇駔軍於泥陽。賜食邑武成六千戶。以隴西都尉從擊項籍軍五月，出鉅野，與鐘離眛戰，疾鬬，受梁相國印，益食邑四千戶。以梁相國將從擊項羽二歲三月，攻胡陵。"}],"rationale":"按本篇分傳、明示姓名與敘事承接限定異稱。酈寄字況據第14段；夏侯嬰的嬰限定第16至21段，灌嬰限定第22至33段，桓嬰另人。第6與20、28段楚王信和反韓王信分人；未詳名王侯不補名。同名跨篇同指另待逐項證據。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p012","text":"項羽滅秦，立沛公為漢王。漢王賜商爵信成君，以將軍為隴西都尉。別將定北地、上郡。破雍將軍焉氏，周類軍栒邑，蘇駔軍於泥陽。賜食邑武成六千戶。以隴西都尉從擊項籍軍五月，出鉅野，與鐘離眛戰，疾鬬，受梁相國印，益食邑四千戶。以梁相國將從擊項羽二歲三月，攻胡陵。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"qcp_ou0_2g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"vok_rjp_tag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"vok_rjp_tag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"vok_rjp_tag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"商","kind":"person","person_id":"bni_7nd_jnt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"焉氏","kind":"person","person_id":"nlt_msz_iuz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"周類","kind":"person","person_id":"cjo_gf9_e2j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"蘇駔","kind":"person","person_id":"ln0_7gp_jh7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"qcp_ou0_2g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m012-0086","start"